{"content_hash": "2cc4dec429483ba3", "version_id": 924, "article_id": 93, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "OnePlus puts a cooling fan inside the Ace 7 to keep gamers cool", "title_zh": "一加 Ace 7 把散热风扇装进机身，专为手游玩家降温", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "mydrivers_ev", "source_url": "https://news.mydrivers.com/1/1163/1163909.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600373633615-9b045feaa299?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8cHJvJTIwYWNlJTIwbWFofGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQyODIxOTB8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Badhan Ganesh on Unsplash", "author": "Badhan Ganesh", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@badhanganesh?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/ace-of-spade-playing-card-wYFYDP9r8BY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(28, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(66, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "5044abb86628"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-10", "word_count": 221, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "OnePlus has built an active cooling fan into its new Ace 7 phone, a rare move for a standard model. Along with a 9000mAh battery and a 185Hz screen, the device is aimed squarely at heavy mobile gamers.", "lead_zh": "一加在新款 Ace 7 标准版机身里装入了主动散热风扇，这在标准版机型中并不多见。配合 9000mAh 大电池和 185Hz 屏幕，这款手机明显是冲着重度手游玩家来的。", "preview": "The Ace series has always focused on one goal: pushing gaming performance as far as possible. With the Ace 7, OnePlus takes a more aggressiv", "preview_zh": "Ace 系列一直只专注一件事：把游戏性能推到极致。到了 Ace 7，一加更进一步，把主动风扇装进了机身。风扇配合两条独立风道，合称双路冰河散热系统，能更快把热量排出手机。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 904, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 96.1, "size_bytes": 577584, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 262, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 98.025, "size_bytes": 589104, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 262, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 103.8, "size_bytes": 623808, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 262, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 89.575, "size_bytes": 538416, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 262, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 97.025, "size_bytes": 583056, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 262, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@fa23f15/content/data/versions/924.json", "paragraphs": ["The Ace series has always focused on one goal: pushing gaming performance as far as possible. With the Ace 7, OnePlus takes a more aggressive step by placing an active fan inside the body. The fan works with two separate air channels, together called the dual-channel glacier cooling system, to pull heat out of the phone faster.", "One channel targets the chip, while the other is designed to keep the area around your hands cooler during long landscape gaming sessions. In testing, the fan lowered temperatures by close to 10°C, and games ran at a steady 185 frames per second. Despite the extra hardware, the phone keeps OnePlus's familiar metal frame and rounded corners.", "The screen is a 185Hz fourth-generation Oriental display, the same panel used on the OnePlus 16. Inside, the phone runs a fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite V series chip, which keeps the third-generation Oryon CPU architecture and a 4.6GHz prime core. A 9000mAh glacier battery supports 100W fast charging, so long gaming sessions should not drain it quickly.", "The main camera uses a 200-megapixel sensor, with high-quality two-times cropping covering everyday zoom. Even with the new air vents, OnePlus says the Ace 7 still meets IP66, IP68, IP69 and IP69K dust and water resistance ratings. The company describes it as a standard-edition flagship built around serious mobile players."], "paragraphs_zh": ["Ace 系列一直只专注一件事：把游戏性能推到极致。到了 Ace 7，一加更进一步，把主动风扇装进了机身。风扇配合两条独立风道，合称双路冰河散热系统，能更快把热量排出手机。", "一条风道针对芯片，另一条则用于在长时间横屏游戏时降低手掌附近的温度。实测中，风扇让温度下降近 10℃，游戏也能稳定跑在 185 帧。尽管多了这些硬件，手机仍保留一加熟悉的金属中框和圆角设计。", "屏幕是 185Hz 第四代东方屏，与一加 16 同款。机身内搭载第五代骁龙 8 至尊版 V series 芯片，保留第三代 Oryon CPU 架构和 4.6GHz 超大核。9000mAh 冰川电池支持 100W 快充，长时间游戏也不用太担心电量。", "主摄为 2 亿像素传感器，两倍高素质裁切可应付日常变焦。尽管新增了风道开口，一加表示 Ace 7 仍支持 IP66、IP68、IP69 和 IP69K 防尘防水。官方称这是一台围绕重度手游玩家的标准版旗舰。"], "body": "The Ace series has always focused on one goal: pushing gaming performance as far as possible. With the Ace 7, OnePlus takes a more aggressive step by placing an active fan inside the body. The fan works with two separate air channels, together called the dual-channel glacier cooling system, to pull heat out of the phone faster.\n\nOne channel targets the chip, while the other is designed to keep the area around your hands cooler during long landscape gaming sessions. In testing, the fan lowered temperatures by close to 10°C, and games ran at a steady 185 frames per second. Despite the extra hardware, the phone keeps OnePlus's familiar metal frame and rounded corners.\n\nThe screen is a 185Hz fourth-generation Oriental display, the same panel used on the OnePlus 16. Inside, the phone runs a fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite V series chip, which keeps the third-generation Oryon CPU architecture and a 4.6GHz prime core. A 9000mAh glacier battery supports 100W fast charging, so long gaming sessions should not drain it quickly.\n\nThe main camera uses a 200-megapixel sensor, with high-quality two-times cropping covering everyday zoom. Even with the new air vents, OnePlus says the Ace 7 still meets IP66, IP68, IP69 and IP69K dust and water resistance ratings. The company describes it as a standard-edition flagship built around serious mobile players.", "body_zh": "Ace 系列一直只专注一件事：把游戏性能推到极致。到了 Ace 7，一加更进一步，把主动风扇装进了机身。风扇配合两条独立风道，合称双路冰河散热系统，能更快把热量排出手机。\n\n一条风道针对芯片，另一条则用于在长时间横屏游戏时降低手掌附近的温度。实测中，风扇让温度下降近 10℃，游戏也能稳定跑在 185 帧。尽管多了这些硬件，手机仍保留一加熟悉的金属中框和圆角设计。\n\n屏幕是 185Hz 第四代东方屏，与一加 16 同款。机身内搭载第五代骁龙 8 至尊版 V series 芯片，保留第三代 Oryon CPU 架构和 4.6GHz 超大核。9000mAh 冰川电池支持 100W 快充，长时间游戏也不用太担心电量。\n\n主摄为 2 亿像素传感器，两倍高素质裁切可应付日常变焦。尽管新增了风道开口，一加表示 Ace 7 仍支持 IP66、IP68、IP69 和 IP69K 防尘防水。官方称这是一台围绕重度手游玩家的标准版旗舰。", "text": "The Ace series has always focused on one goal: pushing gaming performance as far as possible. With the Ace 7, OnePlus takes a more aggressive step by placing an active fan inside the body. The fan works with two separate air channels, together called the dual-channel glacier cooling system, to pull heat out of the phone faster. One channel targets the chip, while the other is designed to keep the area around your hands cooler during long landscape gaming sessions. In testing, the fan lowered temperatures by close to 10°C, and games ran at a steady 185 frames per second. Despite the extra hardware, the phone keeps OnePlus's familiar metal frame and rounded corners. The screen is a 185Hz fourth-generation Oriental display, the same panel used on the OnePlus 16. Inside, the phone runs a fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite V series chip, which keeps the third-generation Oryon CPU architecture and a 4.6GHz prime core. A 9000mAh glacier battery supports 100W fast charging, so long gaming sessions should not drain it quickly. The main camera uses a 200-megapixel sensor, with high-quality two-times cropping covering everyday zoom. Even with the new air vents, OnePlus says the Ace 7 still meets IP66, IP68, IP69 and IP69K dust and water resistance ratings. The company describes it as a standard-edition flagship built around serious mobile players.", "vocab": [{"word": "aggressive", "pos": "adj", "zh": "激进的；大胆的", "note": "常形容策略或行动力度大", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "channel", "pos": "noun", "zh": "通道；风道", "note": "此处指散热风道", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "target", "pos": "verb", "zh": "以……为目标", "note": "target the chip 指针对芯片散热", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "steady", "pos": "adj", "zh": "稳定的", "note": "steady frame rate 稳定帧率", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "despite", "pos": "prep", "zh": "尽管", "note": "后接名词，不接句子", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "panel", "pos": "noun", "zh": "面板；屏幕", "note": "display panel 显示屏", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "architecture", "pos": "noun", "zh": "架构", "note": "常用于芯片设计", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "prime core", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "超大核", "note": "手机芯片中的高性能核心", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "drain", "pos": "verb", "zh": "耗尽；耗电", "note": "drain the battery 耗光电量", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sensor", "pos": "noun", "zh": "传感器", "note": "camera sensor 相机传感器", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "crop", "pos": "noun", "zh": "裁切", "note": "摄影中指裁剪画面放大", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "resistance", "pos": "noun", "zh": "抵抗；防护", "note": "water resistance 防水能力", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-10T03:43:09.016021", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.375, "sm": 250, "em": 375, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Ace", "s": 0.375, "e": 0.625, "sm": 375, "em": 625, "cs": 4, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "series", "s": 0.625, "e": 0.988, "sm": 625, "em": 987, "